  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU-China Policy Support Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Overall Objective of this action is to increase the resilience and balance of the EU bilateral relations with China in strategic sectors of interest. The Specific Objective is to strengthen the effectiveness of the high-level exchanges and bilateral dialogues between EU and China with flexible, ad-hoc technical support in view of emerging priorities and relevant policy developments. The Outputs to be delivered by this action contributing to the Specific Objective are: 1.1 Increased effectiveness and efficiency of the organisation, preparation and follow-up of high-level and sectoral dialogues; 1.2 Improved coordination, development, monitoring, sharing and implementation of best practices, standards and international conventions.</narrative>
  </description>
